{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "qidian-sanjiang",
  "site": "qidian.com",
  "revision": 1,
  "match": {
    "host": [
      "m.qidian.com"
    ],
    "pathPrefix": [
      "/sanjiang/"
    ]
  },
  "dataset": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "pos",
        "type": "number",
        "label": "序号"
      },
      {
        "name": "name",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "书名",
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "name": "author",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "作者"
      },
      {
        "name": "category",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "分类"
      },
      {
        "name": "metric",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "字数"
      },
      {
        "name": "desc",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "推荐语"
      },
      {
        "name": "bookId",
        "type": "string",
        "label": "书籍ID"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://m.qidian.com/sanjiang/",
      "headers": {
        "accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "extract",
      "from": "html",
      "engine": "embedded-json",
      "path": "$.pageContext.pageProps.pageData.records[*]",
      "map": {
        "pos": "$index",
        "name": "$.bName",
        "author": "$.bAuth",
        "category": "$.cat",
        "metric": "$.cnt",
        "desc": "$.rec",
        "bookId": "$.bid"
      }
    }
  ],
  "verify": {
    "minRecords": 3,
    "requiredFieldsNonEmpty": [
      "name"
    ],
    "uniqueBy": [
      "bookId"
    ]
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "human",
    "createdAt": "2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z",
    "sampleHash": "real-fetch-2026-11-19",
    "successRate": 1
  },
  "_notes": [
    "起点 SSR 榜单（本周强推 /strongrec/、三江网文新风 /sanjiang/）：数据内嵌在页面 <script type=\"application/json\">，纯 HTTP 可抓。",
    "起点 list 接口榜单（月票/畅销/阅读指数…）走 https://m.qidian.com/webcommon/rank/{api}list，需要 _csrfToken + cookie + referer 三件套，属于会话握手，配方引擎不支持（也不该支持：那等于内置登录态）。这类榜单继续走旧插件。",
    "path 里的 $.pageContext.pageProps.pageData.records[*] 是 2026-11-19 用真实站点核对过的（旧实现里同名数据在 findKeyDeep(st, \"records\")，没写死路径）。若站点改版导致路径失效，verify 会因记录数不足而失败，不会静默产出空数据。",
    "本配方默认不启用（feature flag 关闭），生产仍走 plugins/novel-platform.mjs。"
  ]
}
